{"outcomes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events_api.jsp","depth":0,"index":"indexed","publication":{"status":"published","path":"30 Tools-Models/Doc Sets/audienceview/AudienceView Professional API Documentation Events API 2df0add15a3a.md","markdown":"---\ntype: source\ntitle: \"AudienceView Professional API Documentation: Events API\"\nsource_url: https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events_api.jsp\nrequested_url: https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events_api.jsp\nsource_id: 2df0add15a3a308ed3cbaa8e04779707f0bb94bc8a3d10003866fb2c2289ab95\ncollection: audienceview\nversion: \"\"\ncaptured_at: 2026-09-15T10:20:47.985Z\nsource_content_type: text/html\ncontent_sha256: 707c708f33b8e04af5f64b50c5cbf524747b1fafd645743403d5abdd094f45d7\npublisher: secondbrain-docs\npublisher_version: 3.1.0\n---\nThe links below provide information for one of our test accounts. They are clickable and give you the best example of the structure you will need to parse.  \nYou can replace 284 with \\[Your Client ID\\] when all the shows for the season are built.  \n\nEvents API (Show Information)\n\n[https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)](https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284);jsessionid=EEF4633F77CCDA94E06DAC95BAB12F8D)\n\n[https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)/production(942036)](https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)/production(942036);jsessionid=EEF4633F77CCDA94E06DAC95BAB12F8D)\n\n[https://api.ovationtix.com/public/series/client(284)/department(1219)](https://api.ovationtix.com/public/events/client(284)/department(1219);jsessionid=EEF4633F77CCDA94E06DAC95BAB12F8D)\n\n```\nOutput:\n{\n\t\"serviceMessages\":{\n\t\t\"errors\":[  \n\n\t\t],\n\t\t\"warnings\":[  \n\n\t\t],\n\t\t\"infoMessages\":[  \n\n\t\t],\n\t\t\"allMessages\":[  \n\n\t\t]\n\t},\n\t\"departmentId\":null,\n\t\"clientId\":284,\n\t\"clientName\":\"00-TestAccount\",\n\t\"clientActive\":true,\n\t\"errors\":[  \n\n\t],\n\t\"warnings\":[  \n\n\t],\n\t\"performances\":[{\n\t\t\"performanceId\":10145563, // AudienceView Professional Unique Performance Identifier\n\t\t\"performanceStart\":1498669200000, // Epoch Date the performance starts (time zone agnostic)\n\t\t\"performanceDate\":\"06/28/2017\", // Date that the performance starts (MM/dd/yyyy - Java SimpleDateFormat)\n\t\t\"performanceTime\":\"1:00 PM\", // Time that the performance starts - (h:mm a - Java SimpleDateFormat)\n\t\t\"performanceTime24\":\"13:00:00\", // Time that the performance starts - (HH:mm:ss - Java SimpleDateFormat)\n\t\t\"performanceStartDate\":\"Wed, Jun 28, 2017 - 1:00 PM\", // Date and Time that the performance starts - (\"EEE, MMM d, yyyy - h:mm a\" - Java SimpleDateFormat)\n\t\t\"performanceSuperTitle\":\"Tom McNeal Far Far Away\", // The super title of the performance (can be different from production supertitle)\n\t\t\"performanceSubTitle\":\"Far Away.......\", // The sub title of the performance (can be different from production subtitle)\n\t\t\"performanceNotes\":\"Performance specific notes\", // Details about this specific performance of the run of the show\n\t\t\"availabilityCode\":\"A\", // See below availability codes\n\t\t\"displayCode\":\"T\", // See below display codes\n\t\t\"productionId\":962459, // AudienceView Professional Unique Production Identifier\n\t\t\"productionName\":\"Far Far Away\", // Production Name as specified for display purposes\n\t\t\"hasAvailableTickets\":true,\n\t\t\"tixRemaining\":445, // Number of tickets still available for this performance (This number should NOT be display to consumers for security purposes).\n\t\t\"customMessage\":\"\", // Custom not available message. If and only if the Display Code is set to M, this message should be displayed.\n\t\t\"noRemainingTicketsMessage\":null, // If no tickets are available this is the message to display. (can be null)\n\t\t\"shutoffHour\":2.00, // Number of hours before show time that public ticket sales are turned off\n\t\t\"shutoffHourMessage\":null, // The message to display once public ticket sales are turned off (can be null)\n\t\t\"generalAdmission\":true, // General Admission flags tells you whether consumers will be delegated specific seats or if seating in each section is first come first serve. True is first come first serve. False is specific seating.\n\t\t\"allDayEvent\":false, // If the performance does not have a start time it is an all day event\n\t\t\"doorEntryStartDate\":\"01/17/2018\", // If allDayEvent is true, this states when doors open for the event \n\t\t\"doorEntryStartTime\":\"2:00 PM\", // If allDayEvent is true, this states when doors open for the event\n\t\t\"doorEntryEndDate\":\"01/17/2018\", // If allDayEvent is true, this states when doors close for the event\n\t\t\"doorEntryEndTime\":\"4:00 PM\", // If allDayEvent is true, this states when doors close for the event\n\t\t\"productionLogoLink\":\"https://web.ovationtix.com/trs/clientFile/303987\", // If there is a logo, the link to it will be here\n\t\t\"productionDescription\":\"Some description of the entire run of the show\", // The description for the entire run of the show\n\t\t\"departmentId\":null, // A grouping of productions\n\t\t\"departmentName\":null, // The name of a grouping of productions\n\t\t\"performanceEntryTimes\": [{\n\t\t\tperformanceEntryTimeId: 11,\n\t\t\tentryTime: \"14:45:00\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeFormatted: \"2:45 PM\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeHour: \"14\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeMinute: \"45\",\n\t\t\tdisplaySoldOut: false\n\t\t}, {\n\t\t\tperformanceEntryTimeId: 12,\n\t\t\tentryTime: \"13:45:00\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeFormatted: \"1:45 PM\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeHour: \"13\",\n\t\t\tentryTimeMinute: \"45\",\n\t\t\tdisplaySoldOut: false\n\t\t}]\n\t}]\n}\n```","digest":"2f7bfc4aa559db7e50ef7aea0a2f6010aca3aa787a12862832f5ecee549ddbed","moc":"linked"}}],"counts":{"total":1,"published":1,"unchanged":0,"replaced":0,"conflict":0,"notModified":0,"notFound":0,"fetchFailed":0,"error":0},"cancelled":false,"exitCode":0}
